    thinking: "**Defining Application Scope**\n\nI\'m currently focused on defining the core scope for this cryptocurrency exchange application, with Changelly integration. The goal is to nail down these features: exchanging crypto via the API, displaying transaction history, and implementing basic KYC procedures. The \"request favorite coins\" functionality is on the list too. I\'m considering using `firebase-integration` for data storage.\n\n\n**Refining Core Integration**\n\nI\'m now diving into the Changelly API documentation and Firebase integration details. My immediate focus is integrating Changelly\'s exchange features. I plan to handle KYC, user accounts, and transaction history using Firebase Auth and Firestore. I\'m prioritizing the UI design for a smooth user experience, particularly the swap interface and the KYC form, to ensure a user-friendly experience. A secure full-stack architecture will be used to protect the API key.\n\n\n"
