    web_documents {
      url: "https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQG3MRh4PIbpumjzyhGkGnCEs70ldur2BPtMX7O2zmLblX4Hvkr8MjG0gMOH2cIymd2L6-P7Qz93JSGdhHMbsAuYH2viNRBIFJX20ZEuTnnuhSJdb2XDpJbf8A=="
      title: "changelly.com"
    }
    web_documents {
      url: "https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEHv6wicyqZpKiEzvIH2jAeAKRo9NAlrogDxUIQt-McS7qxC83rDZX9RLxByHIt7bPvEhsZcmhsTzm7ssUyARBmdCcxWA1HJqIpcEPN5f41KT-Tcn06j57_-0FI3p_N0_jS0Za4ee-GuWzPYHyIiHcaKqYSQIe025Ia21q4Ki_ZE44E_IKWxyy5xs5A2A=="
      title: "changelly.com"
    }
    web_documents {
      url: "https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHGgMg-i3KVxIngQL-k_9gMIyjo_t0HeeP3AIV0OPQJ6bhNLFzhGcIto2hXEZFpsV9DlWvf2aPc33vZQ_uZ6q3D_PGkGAJ-avehcCEIQMEd7M6Li1uh19hozUaUSCrAEyTnssvWJ7Sp9vd5NIOJuhQGXOJuOouaDFPPuYYNo2h2Xy9HguPV2aISh9xTN7Fs"
      title: "changelly.com"
    }
    summary: "Changelly provides comprehensive API documentation for its exchange services, including details on calculating exchange amounts, creating transactions, and generating signatures. It\'s important to distinguish between the ChangellyPRO API (for crypto-to-crypto exchanges) and the Changelly Pay API (for fiat-to-crypto/fiat payments), as the authentication and specific methods might vary.\n\n### Exchange Amount Calculation\n\nFor floating-rate exchanges, you can use the `getExchangeAmount` method to estimate the payout. The response will include `amountTo` (the estimated payout amount before fees) and `networkFee` (the fee deducted by the network). To get the amount the user will receive, you should subtract the `networkFee` from `amountTo`[1][2][3].\n\nFor fixed-rate exchanges, the `getFixRateForAmount` method is used to obtain an estimated amount[1].\n\n### Creating Transactions\n\nTo create a transaction, the Changelly API v2 offers two primary methods:\n*   `createTransaction`: For floating-rate exchanges[1][4].\n*   `createFixTransaction`: For fixed-rate exchanges[1][5].\n\nAfter a successful call to one of these methods, you receive a unique transaction ID and a pay-in address for the user to send funds[4][5]. The `createTransaction` method requires parameters such as `from` (pay-in currency), `to` (pay-out currency), `amountFrom` (amount user sends), and `address` (recipient address)[4]. Similarly, `createFixTransaction` requires a `rateId` obtained from previous rate estimation calls[5].\n\n### Transaction Signature Examples\n\nBoth ChangellyPRO and Changelly Pay APIs utilize signatures for authentication.\n\n**ChangellyPRO API (v3)**\nThe ChangellyPRO API v3 uses HS256 for authentication and mentions a signature generation example in its documentation[6].\n\n**Changelly Pay API**\nThe Changelly Pay API provides more detailed examples for generating an `X-Signature` header. The signature is created using an RSA signature with the SHA256 hashing algorithm. The payload for the signature is constructed by concatenating the HTTP method, the request path, the Base64 encoded request body (if any), and a timestamp in the format `METHOD:PATH:[EncodeBase64(BODY)]:TIMESTAMP`[7][8].\n\nHere\'s a conceptual example of signature generation as described for the Changelly Pay API (Node.js example provided in documentation):\n\n1.  **Define keys**: Set your API Public Key and Private Key.\n2.  **Create Private Key Object**: Create a private key object from your private key, specifying its type, format, and encoding (e.g., `pkcs1`, `pem`, `base64`)[8][9].\n3.  **Construct Payload**: Combine the request path and the JSON stringified message (body) to form the payload. For GET requests, the message should be empty[8].\n    `PAYLOAD = path + JSON.stringify(message)`[8]\n4.  **Generate Signature**: Use a cryptographic library to sign the payload with SHA256 hashing and your private key. The result is typically Base64 encoded[8].\n    `signature = crypto.sign(\'sha256\', Buffer.from(payload), privateKeyObject).toString(\'base64\')`[8]\n5.  **Include in Headers**: The generated signature is then passed in the `X-Api-Signature` header, along with your `X-Api-Key`[7][8].\n\nCode examples for Node.js, PHP, Python, and Java for sending signed requests are available in the Changelly Pay API documentation[9].\n\nSources:\n[1] [changelly.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHMegsR_Hmi2XUjqLii7gUt1mr8H3o4A4-k21o2Sj2PWVozttf9mznSRCrxr-36pSxBq5mj-LvHB5681tizg_G972UeD36W2ezFnpznUMJH-iaJe6-751wvnrN5SU2TEw==)\n[2] [changelly.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQG9vR05wrfce58S76nJUwno7QmQYNsjtxaNI8p4rFx42Rjq0kcbeVY5fNAJh7V80EnGkGXMQtR6NVXIChSCPu_QrGaROPLv3m7AHB42cbL4u9vjaYjr09zrYLBmOMi1k3XIHJ9M7-y72ULLCue44f8=)\n[3] [changelly.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHz4bKY7Y0v1RYZLCzAwRPgHkmVYOQGxK_UwdgEUw79WVbfdLgzSSVVENfHbDnudp2ZD3v9G-oc_VNrN0XWL28qx9vXEfMW0SyKYWB5Hci9mgyecdTZ0DrR6kMewbKwKIM0-0YE)\n[4] [changelly.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEfi2tkWPsU9dZtN5S4QUWR8j3SEIUIVNjLPIcChJhqvFgSPDOVTDZdcG9jAIWB4FdRpBWlo8GJcmpMcUMhR_NTbV0lzx-NwFHNWFWL7TAK1GxBTEEMU3PqJBKm1PcmNzXqcNJ7lzn4FyhMQUcvrA==)\n[5] [changelly.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHy4cx1RUgzpkRK2_ia1dPI8kRelAZno-aDqolgSM5BR1so9t1htDPAegg1poqoeNiU1XDzmgfx9hy9QlHbLAgcKJR6wHRAK_2FWWR9Uv_kyaXJGLICON5v47DCHT3ZzUdlVAvzaF5SdoGl4hP37PQ3)\n[6] [changelly.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHIqgHIasMyAY2RUpqMRIRpFBq7rAXhCBX3jO9vQd3gnbrN-8q9V0rePCAxIogNbHnF-VESFDqFZNHceo1MCNVde0nuzreaXFH8DfvMH7NviaY4I9Ce09APmg==)\n[7] [changelly.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQG3MRh4PIbpumjzyhGkGnCEs70ldur2BPtMX7O2zmLblX4Hvkr8MjG0gMOH2cIymd2L6-P7Qz93JSGdhHMbsAuYH2viNRBIFJX20ZEuTnnuhSJdb2XDpJbf8A==)\n[8] [changelly.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEHv6wicyqZpKiEzvIH2jAeAKRo9NAlrogDxUIQt-McS7qxC83rDZX9RLxByHIt7bPvEhsZcmhsTzm7ssUyARBmdCcxWA1HJqIpcEPN5f41KT-Tcn06j57_-0FI3p_N0_jS0Za4ee-GuWzPYHyIiHcaKqYSQIe025Ia21q4Ki_ZE44E_IKWxyy5xs5A2A==)\n[9] [changelly.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHGgMg-i3KVxIngQL-k_9gMIyjo_t0HeeP3AIV0OPQJ6bhNLFzhGcIto2hXEZFpsV9DlWvf2aPc33vZQ_uZ6q3D_PGkGAJ-avehcCEIQMEd7M6Li1uh19hozUaUSCrAEyTnssvWJ7Sp9vd5NIOJuhQGXOJuOouaDFPPuYYNo2h2Xy9HguPV2aISh9xTN7Fs)"
    search_type: SEARCH_WEB_TYPE_WEB
