    modified_response: "The CryptoSwap Elite application is now ready. I have built a secure, full-stack cryptocurrency exchange platform using a technical dashboard aesthetic.\n\n### Key Features Implemented:\n*   **Cryptocurrency Exchange:** Integrated the Changelly API via a secure backend proxy (`server.ts`) to keep your API keys private. This allows users to estimate exchange rates and create transactions for hundreds of coins.\n*   **Transaction History:** All exchanges are saved to Firebase Firestore per user. The History tab provides real-time updates on status, amounts, and clickable transaction IDs.\n*   **Basic KYC Verification:** A dedicated verification module that allows users to submit their identity details, unlocking higher-tier exchange capabilities in the app.\n*   **Favorite Coins:** Users can browse the extensive list of supported coins and star their favorites, which persist across sessions in their Firestore profile.\n*   **Secure Authentication:** Powered by Firebase Auth with Google Login for a seamless and secure entry point.\n\n### Technical Architecture:\n*   **Backend:** Express.ts server acting as a secure middleman for Changelly API calls, handling JSON-RPC signatures using HMAC-SHA512.\n*   **Frontend:** React 19 with Vite, styled with a high-fidelity \"Technical\" theme using Tailwind CSS and Framer Motion.\n*   **Database:** Firestore with hardened security rules (ABAC) to ensure users can only ever access their own data.\n\n### \342\232\240\357\270\217 Required Configuration\nTo enable live exchanges, you must add your Changelly API credentials to the **Secrets** panel in AI Studio:\n1.  **CHANGELLY_API_KEY**\n2.  **CHANGELLY_API_SECRET**\n\nYou can obtain these keys by registering at [Changelly](https://changelly.com/).\n\nThe application is now live in your preview window. You can sign in, complete the KYC verification, and explore the swap interface immediately."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
