  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Concluding the Implementation**\n\nI\'ve finalized all the components. Firebase is up and running for transactional data and KYC. My Node.js proxy is securely managing the Changelly API. The swap interface, history tracking, KYC form, and favorite coins are built, and everything looks slick with the \"Elegant Dark\" design.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have successfully built and themed **CryptoSwap Elite**. The application is now fully functional with a secure backend and a sophisticated, institutional-grade dark aesthetic.\n\n### Key Features Implemented:\n*   **Changelly Exchange Engine**: Integrated the Changelly API via a secure backend proxy (`/api/changelly`) to allow users to fetch real-time rates and create swap transactions.\n*   **Transaction Tracking**: All swaps are persisted in Firebase Firestore, allowing users to view their complete transaction history with real-time status updates.\n*   **Identity Protocol (KYC)**: A dedicated verification flow that unlocks higher-tier exchange capabilities, with status stored securely in the user\'s profile.\n*   **Watchlist Profile**: Users can curate their favorite assets (\"Favorite Coins\") which are persisted to their global user profile.\n*   **Elegant Dark Theme**: Reimagined the interface with a professional deep-black aesthetic, featuring indigo accents, refined typography, and layout-driven navigation.\n\n### Integration Details:\n*   **Backend Proxy**: Created `server.ts` to handle API signing and secret management, ensuring your Changelly keys are never exposed to the client.\n*   **Firebase Integration**: Leveraged Firestore for user profiles and transaction ledgers, and Firebase Auth for secure Google-based sign-in.\n*   **Responsive Sidebar**: Transitioned the navigation to a persistent sidebar layout for a more desktop-focused, \"terminal\" exchange feel.\n\n**To get started**, you will need to add your `CHANGELLY_API_KEY` and `CHANGELLY_API_SECRET` to the **Secrets** panel in AI Studio.\n\n---\n**Verified & Built Successfully.**"
    thinking_duration {
      nanos: 437343953
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
